      "source": "Encapsulates the aggregation framework <code>$sortByCount</code>-operation.\n<br/>\n<code>$sortByCount</code> stage is typically used with <a href=\"Aggregation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Aggregation</code></a> and <code>$facet</code>. Groups incoming documents\nbased on the value of a specified expression and computes the count of documents in each distinct group.\n<a href=\"SortByCountOperation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>SortByCountOperation</code></a> is equivalent to <code>{ $group: { _id: &lt;expression&gt;, count: { $sum: 1 } } }, { $sort:\n{ count: -1 } }</code>.\n<br/>\nWe recommend to use the static factory method <a href=\"Aggregation.html#sortByCount(java.lang.String)\"><code>Aggregation.sortByCount(String)</code></a> instead of creating instances\nof this class directly.",
      "translation": "封装了聚合框架中的 `$sortByCount` 操作。  \n<br/>  \n`$sortByCount` 阶段通常与 <a href=\"Aggregation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Aggregation</code></a> 和 `$facet` 一起使用。它根据指定表达式的值对传入的文档进行分组，并计算每个不同组中的文档数量。<a href=\"SortByCountOperation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>SortByCountOperation</code></a> 等价于 <code>{ $group: { _id: &lt;expression&gt;, count: { $sum: 1 } } }, { $sort: { count: -1 } }</code>。  \n<br/>  \n我们建议使用静态工厂方法 <a href=\"Aggregation.html#sortByCount(java.lang.String)\"><code>Aggregation.sortByCount(String)</code></a>，而不是直接创建此类的实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
